---
title: Thai green curry
servings: 4
tags: [thai, curry, spicy]
source: https://github.com/cooklang/cookcli
description: A fragrant green curry with vegetables and tofu, ready in half an hour.
---

[- Works just as well with chicken or prawns instead of tofu; adjust the cooking time for the protein. -]

Heat @coconut oil{1%tbsp} in a #large wok{} over a high heat.

Add @green curry paste{3%tbsp} and stir-fry for ~{1%minute}, until fragrant.

Pour in the @coconut milk{400%ml} and @vegetable stock{100%ml} and bring to a gentle boil.

Add the @firm tofu{200%g}(cubed) and @bamboo shoots{100%g}(drained).

Add the @red bell pepper{1}(sliced) and @baby corn{100%g}(halved lengthways). Simmer for ~{8%minutes}.

Season with @fish sauce{1%tbsp}, @palm sugar{1%tsp} and the juice of a @lime{1}.

Stir in @thai basil{handful} and @coriander{handful} just before serving.

Serve over @jasmine rice{} with extra lime wedges on the side.
